# Phase 3 frozen data contract — ChatAnalyst TSV surface

Bout: ChatAnalyst phase 3, bout 2 (PLAN STEP 2). This file FREEZES the
complete phase-3 data contract before any task is converted. Every later
bout (plan steps 3-11) builds against this contract; changes after this
bout must be logged as deviations in the bout record and, when they alter
a pinned decision, re-approved.

Load path for every probe and test: `/home/mvazque2/git/scout-ai/lib`
(bash spelling `/bulk/mvazque2/git/scout-ai/lib`).

